    "content" : "BOARD RESOLUTION NO. 973 Series of 2018"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 12,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 78.21, 617.07, 535.43, 657.131 ],
    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 11.6,
    "text color" : "[0.384, 0.372, 0.388]",
    "content" : "AMENDING PERTINENT PROVISIONS OF THE REVISED IMPLEMENTING RULES AND REGULATIONS FOR BATAS PAMBANSA BILANG 220"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 13,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 73.077, 521.56, 541.114, 588.24 ],
    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 11.6,
    "text color" : "[0.384, 0.372, 0.388]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS, Batas Pambansa Big. 220, Series of 1982, authorizes the Housing and Land Use Regulatory Board (HLURB) to establish and promulgate different levels of standards and technical requirements for the development of socialized housing projects in urban and rural areas from those provided in P.O. 957, P.O. 1216, P.O. 1096 and P.O. 1185;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 14,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 73.088, 454.596, 541.35, 508.33 ],
    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 11.6,
    "text color" : "[0.384, 0.372, 0.388]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS the HLURB Board adopted, through Resolution No. 968, Series of 2018, the new tiered price ceiling for socialized subdivision projects as established and ordered in HUDCC Resolution No.1, Series of 2018 otherwise known as \"The Price Ceiling For Socialized Subdivision Projects\";"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 15,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 73.102, 401.319, 540.373, 441.615 ],
    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 11.6,
    "text color" : "[0.384, 0.372, 0.388]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS, the same HUDCC Resolution No.1, Series of 2018, directs the HLURB to formulate and issue the appropriate technical deSign and standards for socialized subdivision projects for the implementation of the new price ceilings;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 16,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 72.93, 336.985, 524.054, 379.21 ],
    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 11.6,
    "text color" : "[0.384, 0.372, 0.388]",
    "content" : "WHEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED, AS IT IS HEREBY RESOLVED, that the following amendments to the Revised Implementing Rules and Regulations (IRR) for B.P. 220, Series of 2001 be, as the same are hereby APPROVED."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 17,
    "level" : "2",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 92.06, 274.36, 541.108, 328.33 ],
