      "font" : "Helvetica",
      "font size" : 11.6,
      "text color" : "[0.408, 0.404, 0.428]",
      "content" : "3. That, the minimum ceiling height for habitable rooms shall be measured from the finished floor line to the ceiling line, if a ceiling is not provided, a minimum headroom clearance of 2.0 meters shall be provided;",
