      "font size" : 11.6,
      "text color" : "[0.408, 0.404, 0.428]",
      "content" : "4. That, saleable lots designated as dupleX/single-attached and/or row house lots shall be provided with housing components, and the price of saleable lots intended for Single-detached units shall not exceed 40% of the maximum selling price for house and lot package.",
